sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Quiz Taker
  participant M as Menu Controller (main.c)
  participant R as Storage (storage.c)
  participant RF as results.txt

  U->>M: choose 2 (View Leaderboard)
  M->>R: show_leaderboard()
  R->>RF: open for reading
  alt file missing or unreadable
    RF-->>R: open fails
    R->>U: "No results stored yet." (no crash, no path shown)
  else file opened
    RF-->>R: records "Name,Score"
    R->>R: skip malformed lines, sort by score descending
    R->>U: ranked leaderboard
  end
  R-->>M: return
  M-->>U: back to main menu
